## AudiencesApi

### Create audience
## Create audience
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/audiences
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "ad_account_id": "<string>",
 "audience_type": "<string>",
 "description": "<string>",
 "name": "<string>",
 "rule": "<string>"
}


### Get audience
## Get audience
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/audiences/{{audience_id}}
Accept: application/json

### List audiences
## List audiences
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/audiences?bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}&order={{order}}&ownershipType={{ownershipType}}&excludeNca={{excludeNca}}
Accept: application/json

### Update audience
## Update audience
PATCH https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/audiences/{{audience_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "ad_account_id": "<string>",
 "audience_type": "<string>",
 "description": "<string>",
 "name": "<string>",
 "operation_type": "<string>",
 "rule": "<string>"
}

